# The root workspace installs Silent Data's gateway (services/silent-data-gateway) from npmjs. A
# developer's ~/.npmrc may route this scope to GitHub Packages, as services/custom-example/.npmrc
# does for that separate workspace. This file takes priority over ~/.npmrc, so the root install
# still finds the gateway. Publishing is not affected: each package's publishConfig.registry wins.
@appliedblockchain:registry=https://registry.npmjs.org/
